[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3571778530","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113116#issuecomment-3571778530","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113116","id":3571778530,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7U5QPi","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-24T16:52:33Z","updated_at":"2025-11-24T16:52:33Z","body":"What's the reason to remove the default arguments? I'm not against it per se, but I usually only remove existing defaults if providing them is risky or unexpected in some way.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3571778530/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3571868320","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113116#issuecomment-3571868320","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113116","id":3571868320,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7U5mKg","user":{"login":"timothyqiu","id":372476,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjQ3Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/372476?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu","html_url":"https://github.com/timothyqiu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-24T17:14:55Z","updated_at":"2025-11-24T17:14:55Z","body":"Failure to clean up will only lead to the accumulation of more unnecessary default parameters. Based on the current count, this has already happened at least five or six times. There will always come a time when they need to be cleared out.\r\n\r\nWhen calling these functions, one could have included all parameters, yet some might be tempted to omit them simply because \"why not?\" Promptly clearing them when it is determined that no one is using them (or that they have never been used) is the most cost-effective way to avoid unnecessary future expenses.\r\n\r\n> I usually only remove existing defaults if providing them is risky or unexpected in some way.\r\n\r\nI usually avoid using default parameters unless there is a reason to. e.g., to avoid changing lots of existing code.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/